   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **I'm Wavin My Dick In The Wind**: rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2003-09-29.reworked** (recommended): source not stated; 26 songs; 146 min [1]. Said about its sound: Levels were originally too hot and every song clipped; the edit normalized them to 98 dB, giving a nice-sounding result [1]\n- **ween2003-09-29.MK4.1644**: source not stated; 26 songs; 145 min [2]. Said about its sound: Quiet passages have some shaking, caused by the mic stand sitting on the venue's spring-loaded floor [2]\n- **ween2003-09-29**: source not stated; 26 songs; 146 min [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2003-09-29.reworked**: taped by unknown; source: AKG 480's [1]. Also: This is a reworked edition of the recording, with song starts and finishes moved around by the editor, aangen [1]\n- **ween2003-09-29.MK4.1644**: taped by Fireball; transferred by Fireball; source: Schoeps MK4's > Billbox Preamp > Sony M1 > DAT Master (44.1kHz/16 bit) [2]. Also: Field recording made with Fireball master gear, supplied as a 44.1kHz/16-bit file set [2]\n- **ween2003-09-29**: taped by unknown; source: AKG 480's [3]",
